WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Research TV v3.0 — eco-knowledge (45s) Narrator Julius

1
00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:07.219
First, claims without timestamps and sources go stale fast and let copied summaries fake consensus.

2
00:00:07.659 --> 00:00:15.813
Second, every claim records valid time, write time, frame, scale, scope, certainty, and source lineage.

3
00:00:16.253 --> 00:00:24.028
Third, checking mathematical proofs across six independent Lean proof kernels removes single-compiler blind spots completely.

4
00:00:24.468 --> 00:00:29.232
When five websites copy the same undated blog post without checking its origin,

5
00:00:29.232 --> 00:00:37.915
naive retrieval systems count five independent witnesses. Tracing provenance back to dated root experiments collapses echoed copies immediately.

6
00:00:38.355 --> 00:00:43.076
Pairing seven-coordinate dated claims for empirical science with six-kernel Lean

7
00:00:43.076 --> 00:00:47.974
proof checking for formal mathematics keeps machine knowledge honest and auditable.
